nd Veritread, an online marketplace for heavy haul transport solution. It also offers transaction, financial, loan payoff, appraisal, inspection, listing, refurbishing, transportation and logistics, data, parts, catastrophe response, and title services. The company serves customers across various asset classes, including automotive, commercial transportation, construction, government surplus, lifting and material handling, energy, mining, and agriculture. RB Global, Inc. was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in Westchester, Illinois."}}